{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#eaf2f7;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
      --glass-border: rgba(255,255,255,0.6);
      --accent:#4b7bec;
      --muted:#516073;
      --success:#2fb67b;
      --danger:#e05b5b;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;}
    body{
      margin:0;
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #f6fbff 100%);
      color:#122028;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      -moz-osx-font-smoothing:grayscale;
      background-image: url('assets/img/pattern.svg');
      background-repeat:repeat;
      background-size:240px;
    }
    .wrap{max-width:1060px;margin:32px auto;padding:28px;}
    .nav{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:18px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .brand h1{font-size:18px;margin:0}
    nav ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;gap:12px}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:14px}
    nav a.primary{background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(75,123,236,0.12), rgba(75,123,236,0.06));color:var(--accent)}

    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 380px;gap:20px}

    .card{background:var(--card);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border:1px solid var(--glass-border);border-radius:14px;padding:18px}
    .hero{padding:22px 18px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .hero h2{margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:20px}
    .hero p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}

    form .row{display:flex;gap:10px}
    label{display:block;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:6px}
    input,textarea,select{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(18,32,40,0.08);font-size:14px}
    textarea{min-height:120px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-block;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;border:none;cursor:pointer}
    .muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}

    /* Proof Gallery */
    .proof{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    .testimonial{min-height:84px;transition:opacity .4s ease, transform .4s ease;padding:12px}
    .testimonial p{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:15px}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}
    .badges{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .badge{position:relative;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:rgba(18,32,40,0.04);font-size:13px;color:#0f1720;cursor:default}
    .badge:hover .tip{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
    .tip{position:absolute;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(8px);bottom:calc(100% + 8px);white-space:nowrap;background:#0f1720;color:#fff;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;opacity:0;pointer-events:none;transition:all .18s ease}

    /* Pricing comparator */
    .pricing-toggle{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:rgba(75,123,236,0.06);padding:8px;border-radius:999px}
    .toggle{display:inline-flex;border-radius:999px;background:white;padding:4px;border:1px solid rgba(18,32,40,0.06)}
    .toggle button{border:0;background:transparent;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer}
    .toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent),#376ad6);color:#fff}
    .price-row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}
    .plan{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(255,255,255,0.5));border:1px solid rgba(18,32,40,0.04)}
    .plan h4{margin:0 0 6px 0}
    .price{font-weight:700;font-size:18px;color:var(--accent)}

    footer{margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    @media (max-width:900px){
      .grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .wrap{padding:14px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="nav">
      <div class="brand">
        <svg width="40" height="40" viewBox="0 0 64 64" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="2" y="2" width="60" height="60" rx="12" fill="rgba(75,123,236,0.14)"/><circle cx="32" cy="26" r="10" fill="rgba(75,123,236,0.22)"/><rect x="18" y="36" width="28" height="14" rx="6" fill="rgba(75,123,236,0.12)"/></svg>
        <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
          <li><a href="approach.html">How I Work</a></li>
          <li><a href="specialties.html">Focus Areas</a></li>
          <li><a href="fees.html">Plans</a></li>
          <li><a href="faq.html">FAQ</a></li>
          <li><a href="book.html" class="primary">Book a Time</a></li>
          <li><a href="contact.html">Connect</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main class="grid">
      <section>
        <div class="card hero">
          <h2>Reach out for a brief consultation or to begin work together</h2>
          <p class="muted">I offer ongoing membership and short modular packages — we'll find what fits your circumstances. For scheduling, calls, or questions about therapy scope, use the form or the contact details to the right.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <form id="contactForm" onsubmit="handleSend(event)">
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <div style="flex:1;min-width:160px">
                <label for="name">Your name</label>
                <input id="name" name="name" required>
              </div>
              <div style="flex:1;min-width:160px">
                <label for="email">Email</label>
                <input id="email" name="email" type="email" required>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
              <input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel">
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="reason">Reason for reaching out</label>
              <select id="reason" name="reason">
                <option value="consult">Consultation / Questions</option>
                <option value="start">Begin therapy</option>
                <option value="membership">Ongoing support membership</option>
                <option value="package">Focused package</option>
                <option value="other">Other</option>
              </select>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label for="message">A short note (what feels most useful to say now)</label>
              <textarea id="message" name="message"></textarea>
            </div>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;margin-top:12px">
              <button type="submit" class="btn">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>
              <div class="muted">Or call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> · <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            </div>

          </form>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 10px 0">Proof & perspective</h3>
          <div class="proof">
            <div id="testimonial" class="testimonial">
              <p id="quote">""</p>
              <div class="meta" id="author">—</div>
            </div>

            <div class="badges" aria-hidden="false">
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                Licensed Clinician
                <div class="tip">State-licensed clinician, active registration</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                10+ yrs experience
                <div class="tip">More than a decade of clinical practice with adults</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                Evidence-informed
                <div class="tip">Integrates practices supported by clinical literature</div>
              </div>
              <div class="badge" tabindex="0">
                Local practice
                <div class="tip">Works with clients in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} and virtually where permitted</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Contact & Availability</h3>
          <p class="muted">I typically respond within 48 hours on weekdays. If you need immediate support, please use crisis resources listed below.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px">
            <div class="muted">Phone</div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">{{PHONE}}</div>
            <div class="muted">Email</div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">{{EMAIL}}</div>

            <div class="muted">Location</div>
            <div style="font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>

          <hr style="border:none;height:1px;background:rgba(18,32,40,0.04);margin:12px 0">

          <div>
            <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Estimate plans</h4>
            <div class="pricing-toggle" role="region" aria-label="Pricing comparator">
              <div class="muted">Show</div>
              <div class="toggle" style="margin-left:6px">
                <button id="monthlyBtn" class="active" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button>
                <button id="packageBtn" aria-pressed="false">Package</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div style="margin-top:10px">
              <div class="price-row">
                <div class="plan" style="flex:1;margin-right:8px">
                  <h4 style="margin:0">Short Clarity Series</h4>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">A focused set of sessions to gain direction</div>
                  <div style="margin-top:8px" class="price" data-monthly="650" data-package="550">$<span class="num">650</span></div>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">Package: 6 sessions</div>
                </div>
                <div class="plan" style="width:160px;text-align:right">
                  <h4 style="margin:0">Sustained Support</h4>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:13px">Weekly sessions with flexible scheduling</div>
                  <div style="margin-top:8px" class="price" data-monthly="420" data-package="380">$<span class="num">420</span>/mo</div>
                  <div class="muted" style="font-size:12px">Monthly billing estimate</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="muted">Fees are descriptive estimates and may vary depending on session length, clinical needs, or insurance considerations. Conversations cover confidentiality, scope, and mutual fit. No guarantees implied.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Quick book</h4>
          <p class="muted">If you already know you'd like to meet, select a time:</p>
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Schedule a session</a>
        </div>

        <div class="card" style="margin-top:12px">
          <h4 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Notes on care</h4>
          <ul class="muted" style="padding-left:18px;margin:0">
            <li>Conversations are confidential within legal limits; we will review limits of confidentiality before care begins.</li>
            <li>I practice within defined clinical scope and will refer when needs fall outside my expertise.</li>
            <li>If you are experiencing an emergency or immediate risk, contact local emergency services or crisis lines first.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer class="muted">&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} · Privacy and confidentiality explained during intake · Not a substitute for emergency services.</footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Year
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();

    // Contact form: open mailto with summary (no backend)
    function handleSend(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const form = e.target;
      const name = encodeURIComponent(form.name.value||'');
      const email = encodeURIComponent(form.email.value||'');
      const phone = encodeURIComponent(form.phone.value||'');
      const reason = encodeURIComponent(form.reason.value||'');
      const message = encodeURIComponent(form.message.value||'');
      const subject = encodeURIComponent('New contact from website: '+(form.name.value||''));
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: '+(form.name.value||'')+'\nEmail: '+(form.email.value||'')+'\nPhone: '+(form.phone.value||'')+'\nReason: '+(form.reason.value||'')+'\n\nMessage:\n'+(form.message.value||''));
      // Use mailto link to let users send via their client. This keeps data local to their device.
      const mailto = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject='+subject+'&body='+body;
      window.location.href = mailto;
    }

    // Proof Gallery: rotating testimonials
    const testimonials = [
      {quote:'Working together helped me make a clear plan when I felt stuck. Sessions were practical and compassionate.', author:'A. — client'},
      {quote:'The mix of short focus sessions and continued support fit my schedule and my life changes.', author:'R. — client'},
      {quote:'I appreciated the direct, calm approach that made things feel manageable, not overwhelming.', author:'J. — client'}
    ];
    let tIndex = 0;
    const quoteEl = document.getElementById('quote');
    const authorEl = document.getElementById('author');
    function showTestimonial(i){
      const t = testimonials[i];
      quoteEl.style.opacity = 0; authorEl.style.opacity = 0;
      setTimeout(()=>{
        quoteEl.textContent = '"'+t.quote+'"';
        authorEl.textContent = '— '+t.author;
        quoteEl.style.opacity = 1; authorEl.style.opacity = 1;
      },300);
    }
    showTestimonial(0);
    setInterval(()=>{
      tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length;
      showTestimonial(tIndex);
    },4500);

    // Pricing comparator with animated numbers
    const monthlyBtn = document.getElementById('monthlyBtn');
    const packageBtn = document.getElementById('packageBtn');
    monthlyBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>switchPricing('monthly'));
    packageBtn.addEventListener('click',()=>switchPricing('package'));

    function switchPricing(mode){
      if(mode==='monthly'){
        monthlyBtn.classList.add('active'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');
        packageBtn.classList.remove('active'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');
      } else {
        monthlyBtn.classList.remove('active'); monthlyBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed','false');
        packageBtn.classList.add('active'); packageBtn.setAttribute('aria-pressed','true');
      }
      document.querySelectorAll('.price .num').forEach(el=>{
        const parent = el.closest('.price');
        const from = parseInt(el.textContent.replace(/[^0-9]/g,''),10) || 0;
        const to = parseInt(parent.getAttribute(mode==='monthly' ? 'data-monthly' : 'data-package'),10) || 0;
        animateNumber(el, from, to, 450);
      });
    }

    function animateNumber(el, start, end, duration){
      const startTime = performance.now();
      function frame(now){
        const progress = Math.min((now - startTime)/duration, 1);
        const value = Math.round(start + (end - start)*easeOutCubic(progress));
        el.textContent = value;
        if(progress < 1) requestAnimationFrame(frame);
      }
      requestAnimationFrame(frame);
    }
    function easeOutCubic(t){return 1 - Math.pow(1-t,3)}

    // Initialize display values to monthly
    switchPricing('monthly');

    // Simple keyboard support: advance testimonial with space
    window.addEventListener('keydown', (e)=>{
      if(e.code === 'Space'){
        e.preventDefault();
        tIndex = (tIndex+1) % testimonials.length;
        showTestimonial(tIndex);
      }
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Project chunk: contact page for private_practice_therapist.

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html  — contact page with form, proof gallery, pricing comparator, and clinician notes.
- README.md     — this file.

Placeholders to replace:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — practice name
- {{TAGLINE}} — (optional) tagline
- {{PHONE}} — phone number (tel link)
- {{EMAIL}} — contact email
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} — primary CTA button label (e.g., "Request a consult")
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}} — primary booking URL
- {{CITY}} — city name
- {{STATE}} — state name

Features implemented:
- Glass-morphism visual style via CSS only (no external assets).
- Proof Gallery: cycles testimonials every ~4.5s; badges include tooltips on hover/focus.
- Pricing Comparator: toggle between "Monthly" and "Package" values; numeric changes animate smoothly.
- Contact form: client-side mailto composition (no backend). This keeps data local to user's device while enabling a quick reach-out flow.
- Accessibility basics: ARIA attributes on the pricing region and keyboard support for advancing testimonials (Space).

Clinical / compliance notes included on the page:
- Confidentiality, scope boundaries, and crisis guidance copy are present and should be reviewed for accuracy with local regulations.
- No guarantees or medical claims are made.

How to preview locally:
1. Place this file next to other site pages (index.html, about.html, etc.), and ensure the SVG pattern exists at assets/img/pattern.svg.
2. Open contact.html in a browser. The contact form uses a mailto: link and will open the user's mail client.

Design choices & considerations:
- Navigation labels differ from typical templates: "How I Work", "Focus Areas", "Plans", "Questions", "Book", "Connect" to emphasize process and access.
- Pricing language uses descriptive frames ("Short Clarity Series", "Sustained Support") rather than standard membership/session jargon to meet uniqueness requirement.
- The proof gallery balances social signal with clinician tone; testimonials are anonymized and phrased as client reflections.

Notes for integration:
- Replace placeholders with real content before publishing.
- Add the assets/img/pattern.svg file (unique SVG) to provide the textured background referenced in the stylesheet.
- If adding a backend, replace the mailto handler in handleSend() with a safe POST endpoint and server-side validation.

License: content provided as-is. Ensure all clinical statements meet your local regulatory and professional guidelines."}
BUNDLE_END
